racters are so charming and engaging  i'd also love to give a shout out to the  series production qualities with its  visuals and sounds will we see more of  the same in season two will we get more  developments in the relationship between  komi and tadano all signs are pointing  to a resounding yes and i'm really  looking forward to it  fourth on our list today is the movie  bubble  [Music]  i've talked about this before and as its  release nears i've retained those  positive impressions for bubble a  brainchild of some of the brightest  minds in the industry bubble in my  thought is a movie showcasing youthful  energy taking place in a tokyo that's  been isolated the movie deals with  people who've since taken up parkour to  battle each other jumping from building  to building it's also the story of a  fated meeting between parkour prodigy  hibiki and uttar a girl with powers it's  hard not to get excited with the trailer  that's dropped the whole thing just  looks breathtakingly beautiful and i  like how the art and animation managed  to capture the thrill of a sport such as  parkour the plot itself doesn't seem to  be anything unique but as i always say  execution is king in these kinds of  things will it be able to ride the hype  into becoming the best standalone anime  movie in 2022 it's honestly too early to  tell but the potential is there and with  these amazing creators at the helm  anything can happen  ah shield hero it's an isakai that i  really liked people looked forward to it  and it had its fair share of  controversies back then funny to think  that what shield hero had to go through  is pretty much child's play compared to  the stuff that's happened to other  titles since then but i digress overall  shield heroes a nice isakai that mainly  thrives on the dynamic of its lead party  the first season was a joy to watch not  only due to the redemption arc and the  payoff which is covered in a satisfying  moments video of mine by the way so  check that o